# Build context for postfix/docker/Dockerfile (built from the repository root,
# in this monorepo and in the public klar-im/engine mirror alike). The image
# builds the engine and the milter from source and fetches the model at first
# start, so nothing built, downloaded or trained on the host belongs in the
# context: a host engine/build carries a CMakeCache from another path and fails
# the configure, engine/model is 400 MB to 2 GB of weights the image must not
# contain, and the monorepo-only trees below would be gigabytes for nothing.
**/build
**/dist
**/.e2e-staging
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
engine/deps
engine/model
engine/models
*.gguf
*.safetensors
.git
.worktrees
.claude
.tftmp
apple
company
data
design
infra
integrations
marketing
model-lab
spamd
website
